-- SwordSlash v2: anime-style VFX
-- Hero elements are 4 stacked emitters (_glow/_rim/_mid/_core) on the same part with identical motion;
-- each uses a white flipbook and gets its colour from Color, so you can recolour the effect without new textures.
-- Generated by vfx/build.mjs from vfx/effects/*.js. Change the spec and rebuild; don't hand-edit.
-- 1) Upload every PNG in textures/ (Asset Manager > Bulk Import) and paste the ids below.
-- 2) Put this ModuleScript in ReplicatedStorage. On each client: require(it).Play(CFrame.new(pos)).
--    (Fire a RemoteEvent with FireAllClients from the server; impact frames + shake only run on clients.)

